<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Invoice Paid — {{invoiceNumber}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Google Sans', Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.30), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
        }
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            width: 125px;
            height: auto;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        .badge-paid {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #059669;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .summary-box {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .summary-row {
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 7px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e8eaed;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .summary-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            padding-top: 12px;
        }
        .summary-label {
            color: #70757a;
            display: inline-block;
            width: 160px;
        }
        .summary-value {
            color: #202124;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .total-row .summary-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #202124;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .total-row .summary-value {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #059669;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #70757a;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #dadce0;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://timemoz.com/logo.png" alt="Timemoz Logo" class="logo">

            <p>Hi <strong>{{employeeName}}</strong>,</p>

            <p>Great news! Your payroll invoice has been marked as <strong>paid</strong>. Please find the details below and check the attached PDF for your records.</p>

            <span class="badge-paid">&#10003; PAID</span>

            <div class="summary-box">
                <div class="summary-row">
                    <span class="summary-label">Invoice Number</span>
                    <span class="summary-value">{{invoiceNumber}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-row">
                    <span class="summary-label">Company</span>
                    <span class="summary-value">{{companyName}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-row">
                    <span class="summary-label">Pay Period</span>
                    <span class="summary-value">{{periodStart}} – {{periodEnd}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-row">
                    <span class="summary-label">Payment Confirmed</span>
                    <span class="summary-value">{{paidAt}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-row total-row">
                    <span class="summary-label">Total Amount</span>
                    <span class="summary-value">{{currency}} {{totalAmount}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>If you have any questions about this payment, please reach out to your manager or HR team.</p>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p>Best regards,<br>The Timemoz Team</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">Jl. Mampang Prapatan Raya no 17c, Mampang Prapatan, Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia, 12790</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">© 2026 Timemoz, Jakarta, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
